  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我是来谢谢您的  (I Came to Thank You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Hearing Chun Yuqiao might be looking for her, Bu Xiaogu knocks on the chief editor's door to thank him for saving her last night, only to walk into a frosty mood. Listen to their Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总在里边吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在呢，你有事自己进去说吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天总编室的气氛不太好，你说话快一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "办公系统出问题了吗？我没给行政下过指令啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那你来这儿干什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是来谢谢您昨天晚上帮我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天为了解决你的问题，浪费了我多少时间你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我离开学校很久了，不知道你们怎么理解职场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果我做的什么事让你误会了，那是你想多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事就出去工作吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总在里边吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Brother Kaiwen, is Mr Chun Yuqiao inside?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在呢，你有事自己进去说吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is in; go right inside and tell him yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天总编室的气氛不太好，你说话快一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The mood in the chief editor's office is tense today, so keep it brief.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "办公系统出问题了吗？我没给行政下过指令啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did the office system break? I did not send any instructions to admin.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那你来这儿干什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what did you come in here for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是来谢谢您昨天晚上帮我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came to thank you for helping me last night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天为了解决你的问题，浪费了我多少时间你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any idea how much of my time solving your problem wasted yesterday?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我离开学校很久了，不知道你们怎么理解职场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I left college long ago and do not know how people your age view the workplace.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果我做的什么事让你误会了，那是你想多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If anything I did gave you the wrong idea, you are overthinking it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事就出去工作吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If there is nothing else, step out and get back to work.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总在里边吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在呢，你有事自己进去说吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天总编室的气氛不太好，你说话快一点。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "办公系统出问题了吗？我没给行政下过指令啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那你来这儿干什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是来谢谢您昨天晚上帮我的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天为了解决你的问题，浪费了我多少时间你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我离开学校很久了，不知道你们怎么理解职场。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果我做的什么事让你误会了，那是你想多了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事就出去工作吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao briskly draws a firm professional line and sends Xiaogu back to her desk without sentimentality. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
